        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released for the iOS App Store in 2019, WYRM has arrived on Steam with a new look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While maintaining its simple and exhilarating gameplay, it's been reborn as WYRM Plus, supporting mouse and controller input, with refined presentation, game balance, and level design!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to conquer this exhilarating high-altitude extreme race!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed ​​through 10km of side-scrolling wire action.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/8191b92ad1665edff6e8de353536c672.poster.avif?t=1767615774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/8191b92ad1665edff6e8de353536c672.webm?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/8191b92ad1665edff6e8de353536c672.mp4?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch anchors with a single button, and enjoy exhilarating action with simple swing and jump controls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your playstyle to your liking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/e262751626bc4a031a90bfe2e6ff6579.poster.avif?t=1767615774\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/e262751626bc4a031a90bfe2e6ff6579.webm?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/e262751626bc4a031a90bfe2e6ff6579.mp4?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it's difficult, collect points and purchase items to see the path to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet deep, it's fun to play through again and again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/46113e04214e3831c5a70f15ec93327e.avif?t=1767615774\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top of the rankings isn't easy. Hone your skills and aim for the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Recommended for players who enjoy fast-paced action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Cyberpunk art and worldview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Challenging gameplay difficulty</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Terms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can freely stream or upload videos of this work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do, please include the title of the work<strong>：）</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released for the iOS App Store in 2019, WYRM has arrived on Steam with a new look!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While maintaining its simple and exhilarating gameplay, it's been reborn as WYRM Plus, supporting mouse and controller input, with refined presentation, game balance, and level design!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to conquer this exhilarating high-altitude extreme race!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed ​​through 10km of side-scrolling wire action.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/8191b92ad1665edff6e8de353536c672.poster.avif?t=1767615774\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/8191b92ad1665edff6e8de353536c672.webm?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/8191b92ad1665edff6e8de353536c672.mp4?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch anchors with a single button, and enjoy exhilarating action with simple swing and jump controls!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your playstyle to your liking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/e262751626bc4a031a90bfe2e6ff6579.poster.avif?t=1767615774\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/e262751626bc4a031a90bfe2e6ff6579.webm?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/e262751626bc4a031a90bfe2e6ff6579.mp4?t=1767615774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it's difficult, collect points and purchase items to see the path to victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet deep, it's fun to play through again and again.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4221430/extras/46113e04214e3831c5a70f15ec93327e.avif?t=1767615774\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top of the rankings isn't easy. Hone your skills and aim for the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Recommended for players who enjoy fast-paced action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Cyberpunk art and worldview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Challenging gameplay difficulty</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Terms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can freely stream or upload videos of this work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do, please include the title of the work<strong>：）</strong></p>",
